<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and heifers sold $0.50 to 1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1100-1450 lbs 62.00-64.90, few High Choice to 65.25.  Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1350 lbs 59.00-61.50. Select 2-3 1150-1300 lbs 57.00-59.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 950-1450 lbs 61.50-63.75.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 package 1139 lbs 60.10. Select 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 56.00-59.00.</p>
</text>
